{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "93130931-a9e7-81c5-8a62-ec5dcf250f3f",
  "created_at": "2026-01-05T10:39:53-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Anabela Gomes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:34:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. Good morning, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:35:02-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, morning. Um, I got a noise problem. A neighbor with a generator. Can you hear me okay? I got you on speaker."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:35:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine, a little echoey but fine. A generator, you said?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:35:20-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep. Runs all night long. Every night. Goes on till, I don't know, six, seven in the morning. About two weeks now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:35:30-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two weeks, oh, that's no good. Nobody can sleep with that going. Is it a house next to you, or across the way?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:35:41-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Next door, the back side. Their yard comes right up against my bedroom window. I'm at 446 Chapel Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:35:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "446 Chapel, okay, up on the Hill. Let me write that down. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:35:57-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anabela Gomes. G-O-M-E-S."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:35:59-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Ms. Gomes. Now, is the power out over there, or is it just that they run it for some reason?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:36:09-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Power's fine. Mine's on, the whole street's on. I don't know what they're doing with it. Maybe heating a shed, maybe it's a work thing. [pause] I don't care what it is. It's loud."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:36:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Have you talked to them at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:36:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Knocked once. Nobody answered. Left a note. Nothing. That's the way it goes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:36:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mm, yeah. Well, you did the neighborly thing at least."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:36:41-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So what are the quiet hours? That's what I want to know. What time does it have to be quiet in this city?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:36:52-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. In general, Newport has nighttime quiet hours, late evening through early morning, but I don't want to give you the wrong start and end times off the top of my head. The noise rules are handled by the police department for the actual complaint, and there's an ordinance people can look up. I can get you pointed the right way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:37:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Police. For a generator. They got better things to do."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:37:24-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They might, but for an ongoing nighttime noise, that's the line they'd want you to use, the non-emergency number, not 911. And if it's happening again tonight, calling while it's actually running helps, because then somebody can hear it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:37:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I call at three in the morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:37:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If that's when it's going, yes. I know, not what you want to hear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:37:53-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm. I only ever used the front counter before. Down at City Hall. Paper stuff, you know. Never called about nothing like this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:38:04-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. Well, you can still come to the counter if you'd like something in writing. I can take down your complaint here, too, so there's a record that you reached out, and I'll pass it along to the right people."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:38:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, do that. Put it down. Two weeks, every night, generator, 446 Chapel."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:38:29-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Every night, overnight, until about six or seven, next door behind you. Is it a landlord situation? Do you rent?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:38:39-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I rent. My landlord's out of state. Not calling him. He'd do nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:38:46-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll note that you rent, that's all. And a callback number, in case someone wants to follow up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:38:55-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0197."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:38:56-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0197. Perfect. I can't promise who calls or when, but it'll be on file with today's date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:39:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. And the quiet hours, who tells me those? Exactly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:39:09-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The ordinance itself has the exact hours. If you come by the counter, we can print you the noise section so you have it in hand. Or the city website has the code online."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:39:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll stop by. Paper's better. I can wave it at them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:39:31-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, maybe a copy with the police number on it first. But yes, come on in. We're here till the afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:39:41-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks, Sandra."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:39:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Gomes. I hope you get some sleep tonight. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T10:39:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. We'll see. Bye."
    }
  ],
